Team AI capability building cannot happen overnight; it should follow the three-stage rhythm of “able to use → able to build → able to evolve”:  
● Months 1-2 (able to use): push all members to master the /start full workflow, adversarial Code Review, and 14 security rules, laying a solid foundation for usage;  
● Months 2-4 (able to build): core members begin writing team-specific Skills, validating effects through A/B experiments, establishing a Skill-sharing mechanism, and forming a pool of team wisdom;  
● Months 4-12 (able to evolve): move toward Harness automation, promote cross-team knowledge sharing, continuously track AI usage effects, and build a self-iterating AI collaboration flywheel.

