In the face of AI Coding, teams need to maintain a clear balance among three attitudes:  
Careful—humans must review every line of AI-generated code and cannot blindly trust it;  
Aggressive—proactively choose high-frequency scenarios for deep use, not just superficial trial;  
Embrace—actively evangelize and promote, making AI capability part of the team culture.  
And no matter how tools evolve, always master the underlying principles—this is the ultimate ballast for engineers to maintain judgment and control in the era of human-AI collaboration.
